1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,597
Ava: PyTorch Day China 2026 has a proposal deadline coming up: November 10 at 23:59 China Standard Time.
Ava：PyTorch Day China 2026 的提案截止时间快到了：11月10日中国标准时间23:59。

2
00:00:08,597 --> 00:00:14,678
If you work on training, inference, or hardware, the call may fit.
如果你从事训练、推理或硬件相关工作，可以考虑投稿。

3
00:00:14,678 --> 00:00:17,842
Brian: The event is in Beijing on December 12.
Brian：活动将于12月12日在北京举行。

4
00:00:17,842 --> 00:00:28,900
It brings together PyTorch developers, machine learning engineers, AI researchers, and open source AI leaders from China and beyond.
届时，中国及其他地区的 PyTorch 开发者、机器学习工程师、AI 研究人员和开源 AI 领袖将齐聚一堂。

5
00:00:28,900 --> 00:00:32,202
Ava: What formats and topics does it cover?
Ava：接受哪些演讲形式？涵盖哪些主题？

6
00:00:32,202 --> 00:00:36,220
Brian: It welcomes session presentations and lightning talks.
Brian：接受专题演讲和闪电演讲。

7
00:00:36,220 --> 00:00:44,924
Model Training & Post-Training covers distributed training, SFT, reinforcement learning, and preference optimization.
“模型训练与后训练”涵盖分布式训练、SFT、强化学习和偏好优化。

8
00:00:44,924 --> 00:00:53,384
Efficient Inference & Deployment covers LLM inference, quantization, optimization, and deployment strategies.
“高效推理与部署”涵盖大语言模型推理、量化、优化和部署策略。

9
00:00:53,384 --> 00:00:59,830
Ava: Compiler work seems to have a place in PyTorch Core & Hardware Acceleration.
Ava：编译器方面的工作似乎适合“PyTorch 核心与硬件加速”主题。

10
00:00:59,830 --> 00:01:09,254
Brian: That area includes compilation, kernel optimization, performance profiling, and GPU and AI accelerator technologies.
Brian：这一主题涵盖编译、算子优化、性能分析，以及 GPU 和 AI 加速器技术。

11
00:01:09,254 --> 00:01:17,484
Physical AI includes robotics, VLA models, perception and control, and simulation-based training.
“物理 AI”涵盖机器人、VLA 模型、感知与控制，以及基于仿真的训练。

12
00:01:17,484 --> 00:01:24,564
Ava: And PyTorch Ecosystem & Applications covers tools and applications that expand the ecosystem.
Ava：“PyTorch 生态与应用”则涵盖扩展生态的工具和应用。

13
00:01:24,564 --> 00:01:27,122
When will speakers hear back?
演讲者什么时候能收到通知？

14
00:01:27,122 --> 00:01:34,935
Brian: Notifications are scheduled for November 17, and the schedule announcement follows on November 18.
Brian：通知计划于11月17日发出，日程安排将于11月18日公布。

15
00:01:34,935 --> 00:01:41,552
If you're proposing a talk, November 10 at 23:59 China Standard Time is the cutoff.
如果你打算提交演讲提案，截止时间是11月10日中国标准时间23:59。

16
00:01:41,552 --> 00:01:43,576
Thanks for listening.
感谢收听。
